{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T10:31:00.898Z","author":"toolchain-web-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"dea03de07548ea698db91bc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T10:31:00.897Z","author":"toolchain-web-1103","text":"Hosted-facing views check: the history panel and the item detail timeline consume only pm-web's own /pm/history route, whose ItemHistoryPage/HistoryResponse contract is a literal order:'oldest_first' (src/services/item-history.ts and public/src/api-types.ts). The frontend's reverse-to-display logic therefore relies on the server contract, not on the CLI's projection defaults, and GH-1617 cannot change it; the server now also requests oldest_first explicitly from the host. No frontend change needed."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T10:31:00.898Z"}],"before_hash":"13618953c245ca60c945af3a8f01da5764bcaaf0e67402e2d496fb38ac67ff13","after_hash":"cbb533c0a95180e11c115e387d578426f8fd8269afd16648309fefcd8df80e6d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"bcddc4aaa2f3e94014f9a2c62aa39d4ceafacb943a0f0ca0fdf2f51eec00d23f"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T11:14:53.815Z","author":"toolchain-web-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"dea03de07548ea698db91bc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T11:14:53.807Z","author":"toolchain-web-1103","text":"Gates: node --test test/item-history-projection.test.ts 7/7 pass (A/B verified: the new explicit-order regression test fails without the src fix). Full npm test: 884 tests, 881 pass; the 3 failures are host npm policy, not code (EALLOWSCRIPTS refusal of project-scoped installs spawned by tests). Reran the affected files with NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null (CI-equivalent env): the old-version normalization suite passes and catalog-install-e2e passes 3/3. typecheck pass, lint pass, changelog:check up to date, dist rebuilt and committed. No upstream regressions found in pm-cli 2026.10.30 history behaviour: the compact projection now labels its order explicitly and the normalizer handles the label correctly."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T11:14:53.815Z"}],"before_hash":"cbb533c0a95180e11c115e387d578426f8fd8269afd16648309fefcd8df80e6d","after_hash":"bf6292b539502f1984364fc13420f2d1271a29f5b7d9bd51f8a4377237dff717","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0b3b62b0d555d35c8d2179aaf4ddf332a2f89e05be47282cdc37c9d59f6d27a7"}
